{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51119","headline":"石上流泉 · 崔致远","name":"石上流泉","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琴曲虽夸妙手弹，远轮云底响珊珊。\n静无纤垢侵金镜，时有轻飔触玉盘。\n呜咽张良言未用，潺湲孙楚枕应寒。\n寻思堪惜清冷色，流入沧溟便一般。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔致远","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51119.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51119","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}